## Original Content
Une tornade d’une rare violence a frappé lundi en fin d’après-midi le village de Pomas, près de Carcassonne. En moins de cinq minutes, le phénomène a fait 39 blessés, dont deux personnes en urgence absolue, et a détruit ou endommagé près de 300 habitations. Reportage France 2.

## Summary
A tornado of rare violence struck the village of Pomas near Carcassonne, France, on Monday afternoon. In less than five minutes, it caused 39 injuries, including two in absolute emergency, and damaged or destroyed nearly 300 homes.

## Key Points
- The tornado was described as having rare violence.
- It hit Pomas village near Carcassonne, France.
- In under five minutes, it resulted in 39 injuries, with two critical cases.
- Nearly 300 homes were destroyed or damaged.


